# Check every text file out with LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# install.sh fails under bash with CRLF; SKILL.md front matter and the templates
# are parsed by agents, and a CRLF checkout leaves \r inside YAML values; the
# preset block is compared line by line inside DSH patch layers.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.bundle binary
